  }
 ],
 "note": "A completed prompt receipt carries result {turn_id, user_message_id, outcome, reply_message_ids, more, replies}. reply_message_ids lists at most the first 32 replies in timeline order; more: true says history{request_id} pages hold the rest. Only turn_id, user_message_id and outcome are journaled; reply ids are computed from retained history when the receipt is sent. A receipts reply holds at most 64 receipts, each bounded, so it stays far below 1 MiB. Nothing is dispatched again to recover replies."
}